<title>HONG KONG: Ngai Lik Ind interim profit rises 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Ngai Lik Ind interim profit rises 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.9    vs 4.2 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    31.03  vs 29.02</p>
<p>    Turnover		     650.83 vs 532.76</p>
<p>    Company name		 Ngai Lik Industrial Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 13-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Ngai Lik Industrial makes consumer audio products.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings figure adjusted for one-for-one bonus issue of shares made in August 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
